      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "INTENSIFIED (1) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (16.58) last time in a Grade 6 at this track. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to his name from seven starts. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. THIS BAD BOY (8) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (22.22) at this track behind Shake Not Stir in a Grade 6. Turned chasing the leaders but kept coming. Expected to feature again. VICTORY BRAVO (2) collided with another runner and finished a well held 7 lengths fifth (23.23) last time in a Grade 6 at Mandurah over 400m. Must include in calculations. JAYDE MCCOOL (4) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
